{%- comment -%}
  Pre-translated seasonal copy for sections/hero-banner.liquid.

  Translate & Adapt keeps serving the old translation of a section setting after
  its English source changes, so seasonal hero copy that must match the art and
  links in every storefront language lives here instead of in section settings.

  Usage:
  {%- capture text -%}{%- render 'hero-seasonal-copy', edition: 'halloween_winter', key: 'heading', lang: 'es' -%}{%- endcapture -%}

  Editions: halloween_winter, christmas. sections/hero-banner.liquid swaps
  halloween_winter for christmas from Oct 16 to Dec 31 (shop time).

  Keys: eyebrow, heading, subheading, cta_primary, cta_secondary, cta_tertiary,
  alt_1 and alt_2 (slide alt text; empty for English, which uses the slide's image_alt).
  christmas also has alt_3 (alt text for its product slides; English is the fallback
  when a product image has no alt) and link_primary, link_secondary, link_tertiary
  (CTA links that replace the section's button links while that edition shows).
  `lang` is the two-letter language code (pt-BR -> pt). Unknown languages fall back to English.
  Output is plain text; escape it where it is rendered.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign copy_id = edition | append: ':' | append: key
